; Bull — model scene for AnimalDefinition.model_scenes.
; Source: Quaternius "Ultimate Animated Animal Pack" (July 2021), CC0 1.0 — same pack as
; Fox; see project/attribution/sources/quaternius_ultimate_animated_animals.tres.
;
; Design role: art.md → Newly Available Animals proposes cultivated, open_grass · Bold,
; farm-tolerant · barnyard life by the village, paired with Cow. Not locked design.
;
; Audit (2026-07-26): 13 animation clips confirmed — Idle, Idle_2, Idle_Headlow,
; Idle_HitReact1/2, Walk, Gallop, Gallop_Jump, Jump_toIdle, Eating, Attack_Headbutt,
; Attack_Kick, Death. Idle/Walk both present and non-degenerate (47 tracks each). Node
; structure matches Fox (AnimalArmature -> Skeleton3D -> mesh; AnimationPlayer sibling
; index 1).
;
; STYLE NOTE (flag, not a rejection per this task's non-floor rule): the mesh under
; Bull's Skeleton3D is literally named "Cow" and its AABB is byte-identical to Cow's
; (4.586672 x 8.066984 footprint) — Bull appears to be the same base mesh as Cow,
; distinguished only by its own texture/material within this glTF, not a horned or
; heavier-built model. Visually Bull and Cow may read as recolors of the same silhouette
; rather than two distinct animals. Not a license/animation problem, just a look-pass fact
; for the human to weigh when deciding whether Bull earns a separate roster slot.
;
; Scale: 0.16 (20% reduction from the original 0.2, matching Fox's established factor
; for this pack — same rationale as Deer.tscn). Raw AABB height 4.587 -> scaled height
; 0.734 (same as Cow, per the note above). FLAG FOR HUMAN REVIEW: not yet eyeball-
; confirmed in engine.
